  5300-noaa-hurricane-documents            12      0     0.000 %    0.000 %     0.00 %
  6000-lilith-scans-public-patents         24      2    +0.141 %   +2.991 %    +0.17 %
  6600-ia-scans-manuscript-illustrations    6      2    +0.025 %   +0.136 %    +2.54 %
